\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b1b899d5ae3caf58\" href=\"?note=b1b899d5ae3caf58\" title=\"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§12.7, Example 12.9 and following nonexample, pp. 313–314; scans 321–322"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.7, Example 12.9 and following nonexample, pp. 313–314; scans 321–322"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50c58c8a099098f6\" href=\"?note=50c58c8a099098f6\" title=\"73-df-blum-complexity-measure\">73-df-blum-complexity-measure</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{stime}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{stime}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a>，此部分函数对任意二进制 DTM 定义，不要求机器在多项式时间内运行。停机不可判定性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b1b899d5ae3caf58\" href=\"?note=b1b899d5ae3caf58\" title=\"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^{\\mathsf t},\\Phi^{\\mathsf v}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^2)\">\\(\\Phi^{\\mathsf t},\\Phi^{\\mathsf v}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^2)\\)</span> 是下式定义的代价图族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blum\\text{-}time\\text{-}measure\\text{-}and\\text{-}nonexample}\\vdash\n\\Phi^{\\mathsf t}(e)\\coloneqq\\{(x,m)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\beta(e)\\land(\\beta(x),m)\\in\\operatorname{stime}_M)\\},\\qquad\\Phi^{\\mathsf v}(e)\\coloneqq\\varphi_e\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blum\\text{-}time\\text{-}measure\\text{-}and\\text{-}nonexample}\\vdash\n\\Phi^{\\mathsf t}(e)\\coloneqq\\{(x,m)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\beta(e)\\land(\\beta(x),m)\\in\\operatorname{stime}_M)\\},\\qquad\\Phi^{\\mathsf v}(e)\\coloneqq\\varphi_e\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blum\\text{-}time\\text{-}measure\\text{-}and\\text{-}nonexample}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi^{\\mathsf t})\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi^{\\mathsf v})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}blum\\text{-}time\\text{-}measure\\text{-}and\\text{-}nonexample}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi^{\\mathsf t})\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi^{\\mathsf v})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>对合法机器码，恰好模拟 m 步即可判定停机时间是否等于 m，非法码一律无代价；数值接口保证收敛域一致。若把输出值当代价，则可把任意停机实例编译成仅在停机后输出数值 1 的程序，再查询其精确代价是否为 1，从而判定停机，矛盾。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-blum-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"50c58c8a099098f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-blum-complexity-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-blum-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"50c58c8a099098f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-blum-complexity-measure]] 的同一 $\\mathcal E$、$\\varphi_e$ 和 $\\beta$。$\\operatorname{stime}_M$ 见 [[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]，此部分函数对任意二进制 DTM 定义，不要求机器在多项式时间内运行。停机不可判定性见 [[73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability]]。$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi^{\\mathsf t},\\Phi^{\\mathsf v}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^2)$ 是下式定义的代价图族。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-s